---
import Layout from '../components/Layout.astro';
import Icon from '../components/Icon.astro';
import SectionHeader from '../components/SectionHeader.astro';
---
<Layout active="services" title="Services — NÉGOCE ET COMMERCE DE RIM" description="General commerce, sourcing and import-export coordination between Mauritania and international partners.">
  <section class="section"><div class="container"><div style="max-width:820px"><div class="kicker" data-en="Services" data-es="Servicios" data-fr="Services">Services</div><h1 class="h1" data-en="General commerce, sourcing and import-export coordination." data-es="Comercio general, sourcing y coordinación import-export." data-fr="Commerce général, sourcing et coordination import-export.">General commerce, sourcing and import-export coordination.</h1><p class="lead" data-en="We support opportunities where Mauritania can act as a market, a source of supply or a strategic connection point for companies from Spain and other international markets." data-es="Apoyamos oportunidades donde Mauritania puede actuar como mercado, origen de suministro o punto estratégico de conexión para empresas de España y otros mercados internacionales." data-fr="Nous soutenons les opportunités où la Mauritanie peut être un marché, une source d’approvisionnement ou un point de connexion pour des entreprises d’Espagne et d’autres marchés.">We support opportunities where Mauritania can act as a market, a source of supply or a strategic connection point for companies from Spain and other international markets.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container grid four"><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="factory" /></div><h3 data-en="Products for Mauritania" data-es="Productos para Mauritania" data-fr="Produits pour la Mauritanie">Products for Mauritania</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We evaluate goods that can serve local industry, maritime activity, distributors and professional users." data-es="Evaluamos productos que pueden servir a industria local, actividad marítima, distribuidores y usuarios profesionales." data-fr="Nous évaluons les produits pour l’industrie locale, le maritime, les distributeurs et utilisateurs professionnels.">We evaluate goods that can serve local industry, maritime activity, distributors and professional users.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="ship" /></div><h3 data-en="Products from Mauritania" data-es="Productos desde Mauritania" data-fr="Produits depuis la Mauritanie">Products from Mauritania</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We open conversations around Mauritanian supply opportunities, especially in maritime and resource-linked sectors." data-es="Abrimos conversaciones sobre oportunidades de suministro mauritano, especialmente en sectores marítimos y vinculados a recursos." data-fr="Nous ouvrons des échanges autour de l’offre mauritanienne, notamment maritime et ressources.">We open conversations around Mauritanian supply opportunities, especially in maritime and resource-linked sectors.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="handshake" /></div><h3 data-en="Representation" data-es="Representación" data-fr="Représentation">Representation</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We can represent products or companies seeking a practical commercial presence in Mauritania." data-es="Podemos representar productos o empresas que buscan presencia comercial práctica en Mauritania." data-fr="Nous pouvons représenter des produits ou entreprises cherchant une présence commerciale en Mauritanie.">We can represent products or companies seeking a practical commercial presence in Mauritania.</p></div><div class="card"><div class="icon-box"><Icon name="document" /></div><h3 data-en="B2B coordination" data-es="Coordinación B2B" data-fr="Coordination B2B">B2B coordination</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We coordinate specifications, quantities, documents, destinations and commercial next steps." data-es="Coordinamos especificaciones, cantidades, documentos, destinos y próximos pasos comerciales." data-fr="Nous coordonnons spécifications, quantités, documents, destinations et étapes commerciales.">We coordinate specifications, quantities, documents, destinations and commercial next steps.</p></div></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container"><SectionHeader kicker="What we look for" kickerEs="Qué buscamos" kickerFr="Ce que nous recherchons" title="Opportunities with clear demand, clear supply and serious partners." titleEs="Oportunidades con demanda clara, suministro claro y socios serios." titleFr="Des opportunités avec demande claire, offre claire et partenaires sérieux." /></div></section>
  <section class="section-sm"><div class="container grid two"><div class="surface" style="border-radius:34px;padding:34px"><h3 data-en="For Spanish and European companies" data-es="Para empresas españolas y europeas" data-fr="Pour les entreprises espagnoles et européennes">For Spanish and European companies</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We can help explore whether a product has a path in Mauritania: maritime supplies, technical goods, industrial consumables, machinery support, lubricants, food-related products and other B2B categories." data-es="Podemos ayudar a explorar si un producto tiene recorrido en Mauritania: suministros marítimos, productos técnicos, consumibles industriales, apoyo a maquinaria, lubricantes, productos alimentarios y otras categorías B2B." data-fr="Nous pouvons explorer si un produit a un potentiel en Mauritanie : fournitures maritimes, produits techniques, consommables industriels, support machines, lubrifiants, produits alimentaires et autres catégories B2B.">We can help explore whether a product has a path in Mauritania: maritime supplies, technical goods, industrial consumables, machinery support, lubricants, food-related products and other B2B categories.</p></div><div class="surface" style="border-radius:34px;padding:34px"><h3 data-en="For buyers interested in Mauritania" data-es="Para compradores interesados en Mauritania" data-fr="Pour les acheteurs intéressés par la Mauritanie">For buyers interested in Mauritania</h3><p class="muted" data-en="We can help initiate conversations around fisheries, maritime activity, resource-related opportunities and local commercial relationships." data-es="Podemos ayudar a iniciar conversaciones sobre pesca, actividad marítima, oportunidades vinculadas a recursos y relaciones comerciales locales." data-fr="Nous pouvons aider à initier des échanges autour de la pêche, l’activité maritime, les ressources et les relations commerciales locales.">We can help initiate conversations around fisheries, maritime activity, resource-related opportunities and local commercial relationships.</p></div></div></section>
</Layout>
